 The default off reproduces the stock shower.
 </flag>
  
+<flag name="SpaceShower:IFtopSoftCorrection" default="off">
+Experimental massive-top soft correction for q to qg on a current
+initial-final colour connection to an outgoing top. Multiply the branching
+veto weight by pT2corr/(pT2*z1), with z1=1-z*Q2/(m2ColPair-m2ColPartner).
+This is the massive/massless eikonal ratio and is bounded between zero
+and one on the accepted phase space. It approaches one for incoming
+collinear radiation. Evaluate from the current dipole after every update;
+never apply to gluon IF splittings or to the final-final top-gluon shower,
+whose existing recoil dead-cone correction is retained. Use MECs off and
+matching counterterms for the modified rate. Default off preserves stock.
+</flag>
